# Real host configuration: contains root credentials, never commit it.
# config/default.nix is gitignored and never part of the flake source; the
# flake always builds config/example.nix. Supply a real config via the CLI
# (`nix run . -- <config.nix>`) or `lib.mkPve { config = ...; }`.
